tps://t.co/PzllMDC"}],"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"904882629282897920","indices":[3,14],"name":"内閣府経済財政政策","screen_name":"cao_keizai"}]},"favorite_count":0,"favorited":false,"full_text":"RT @cao_keizai: 11月11日(水)に経済財政諮問会議を開催しました。\n\n令和８年第16回経済財政諮問会議　議題\n1. マクロ経済運営（金融政策、物価等に対する集中審議）\n2. 成長志向型で持続可能な社会基盤の在り方①他\n\nhttps://t.co/PzllMDC…","id_str":"2120470641631736301","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":18,"retweeted":false,"retweeted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":0},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1050188235106709509/eKqo0CM3_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/904882629282897920/1763380225"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Sep 05 01:43:25 +0000 2017","name":"内閣府経済財政政策","screen_name":"cao_keizai"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo5MDQ4ODI2MjkyODI4OTc5MjA=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"〒100-8914　東京都千代田区永田町1-6-1"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"内閣府経済財政政策の公式アカウントです。内閣府政策統括官（経済財政運営担当）が運営しています。運用方針https://t.co/B2Z1FfdNxWを御確認のうえ御利用下さい。ヘッダー画像は経済財政諮問会議の模様（出典：首相官邸HP）","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"www5.cao.go.jp/keizai/sns/tox…","expanded_url":"https://www5.cao.go.jp/keizai/sns/tox.html","indices":[51,74],"url":"https://t.co/B2Z1FfdNxW"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"www5.cao.go.jp/keizai/index.h…","expanded_url":"https://www5.cao.go.jp/keizai/index.html","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/ODrQBP6DIJ"}]}}},"profile_description_lan